<h2>TBL01</h2>

<p>This component allows you to add a two column table to the site.</p>

<p><strong>Possible placement:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Content zone</li>
    <li>Margin column</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Options:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Striped (default)</li>
    <li>Bordered</li>
    <li>Bordered and striped</li>
</ul>

<div class="pl-c-text-passage">
    <p><strong>CSS-Classes:</strong></p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Element</th>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th>CSS-Class</th>
                <th>Default value</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>&#60;table&#62;</td>
                <td>Table style (combination of one or more classes)</td>
                <td><code>table-style--striped</code> <code>table-style--bordered</code>
                </td>
                <td><code>table-style--striped</code></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

</div>